{"vid":"eqbJs9UZ68Q","source":"eqbJs9UZ68Q.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":10.1,"txt":"Does the thought of building things"},{"t":11.5,"txt":"spark your interest?"},{"t":12.8,"txt":"Can you focus on details and"},{"t":14.3,"txt":"work with little supervision?"},{"t":16.5,"txt":"Are you good at working with your hands?"},{"t":18.5,"txt":"If so, maybe you should fabricate yourself"},{"t":21,"txt":"a career as a Welder."},{"t":23.3,"txt":"In Alberta"},{"t":24.2,"txt":"there are two branches in the welding trade."},{"t":26.4,"txt":"Welders use heat to fuse metals together"},{"t":29,"txt":"such as beams, girders, pipes,"},{"t":31.2,"txt":"and other components."},{"t":32.8,"txt":"Wire Process Operators"},{"t":34.4,"txt":"work mostly in manufacturing"},{"t":36.1,"txt":"and production plants"},{"t":37.1,"txt":"where they join components together."},{"t":39.4,"txt":"To fill in the blanks"},{"t":40.3,"txt":"about this career"},{"t":41.4,"txt":"we put on some safety goggles"},{"t":42.7,"txt":"and \"bonded\""},{"t":43.5,"txt":"with a Welder working in Alberta."},{"t":49.7,"txt":"Hi I'm Kimberly"},{"t":50.8,"txt":"and I'm a Welder."},{"t":53.5,"txt":"Welders use heat to melt and fuse"},{"t":56.3,"txt":"metal pieces together."},{"t":60.7,"txt":"So what attracted me to welding"},{"t":62.5,"txt":"was the ability to work with my hands"},{"t":66.3,"txt":"in a variety of different environments"},{"t":68.9,"txt":"and also to make a very good living."},{"t":72.6,"txt":"A typical day at work for me includes"},{"t":75.6,"txt":"toolbox talks every morning"},{"t":76.7,"txt":"where we go over any safety hazards"},{"t":78.9,"txt":"that may be of a concern that day"},{"t":80.9,"txt":"and also gearing up in our PPE for the day."},{"t":85.8,"txt":"Then from there we carry on our tasks"},{"t":88,"txt":"whether it may be welding, grinding,"},{"t":90.6,"txt":"cutting of those sorts."},{"t":92.2,"txt":"We also have a little wrap-up meeting"},{"t":94.4,"txt":"where we go over anything"},{"t":95.8,"txt":"that may have happened in the day"},{"t":97,"txt":"or any incidents that may have occurred."},{"t":100.6,"txt":"Some places Welders could work"},{"t":102.2,"txt":"are on the pipeline, in fabrication shops,"},{"t":104.9,"txt":"or in industrial refineries."},{"t":107.1,"txt":"I currently work in an industrial refinery."},{"t":111.4,"txt":"So my duties include very wide variety of things."},{"t":115.5,"txt":"Lots of layout blueprint reading,"},{"t":117.5,"txt":"drilling holes, cutting material,"},{"t":120.1,"txt":"prepping material, welding of course, grinding."},{"t":123.3,"txt":"It also includes cleanup,"},{"t":125.2,"txt":"taking care of my safety equipment,"},{"t":127.2,"txt":"and being safety conscious all at the same time."},{"t":131.1,"txt":"I typically work 40 hours a week"},{"t":132.8,"txt":"with the option of overtime"},{"t":134.3,"txt":"on Fridays and Saturdays."},{"t":136.1,"txt":"And travel may be required for some jobs."},{"t":140.7,"txt":"Skills and characteristics needed"},{"t":142.1,"txt":"to do my work would be"},{"t":144.1,"txt":"physically fit, capable of thinking on the fly,"},{"t":147.6,"txt":"also being able to read blue prints,"},{"t":150.3,"txt":"use basic hand tools,"},{"t":152.4,"txt":"being able to sustain long days"},{"t":154.8,"txt":"there can be long days involved."},{"t":157,"txt":"Early mornings,"},{"t":158.2,"txt":"working outside in the heat, the sun,"},{"t":160.3,"txt":"and also the cold as well."},{"t":164,"txt":"The environment at my workplace"},{"t":165.3,"txt":"is always changing."},{"t":166.6,"txt":"It can be very loud noises,"},{"t":169.1,"txt":"there can be moving equipment,"},{"t":170.6,"txt":"moving machinery."},{"t":173.5,"txt":"So as a Welder you may work individually"},{"t":175.7,"txt":"or as a team."},{"t":177,"txt":"Some examples would be in a shop"},{"t":178.7,"txt":"you tend to weld on your own more"},{"t":180.3,"txt":"where in the fields,"},{"t":181.4,"txt":"commercial, industrial settings"},{"t":184,"txt":"you tend to have at least one partner"},{"t":185.1,"txt":"or multiple partners"},{"t":186.3,"txt":"helping you get the job done."},{"t":189.4,"txt":"Safety is a very important aspect of the job."},{"t":192,"txt":"As Welders we work with torches and hot metal"},{"t":194.2,"txt":"so you need to be very cautious"},{"t":195.5,"txt":"as to not get burned."},{"t":197.7,"txt":"You need to take safety precautions also"},{"t":199.5,"txt":"for your health, with respirators"},{"t":202.2,"txt":"that type of thing."},{"t":204.8,"txt":"To become a Welder"},{"t":205.6,"txt":"you have to do a three-year apprenticeship."},{"t":207.8,"txt":"After those three years"},{"t":209.2,"txt":"you become a journeyperson."},{"t":211.6,"txt":"Some additional training to get"},{"t":212.9,"txt":"after your journeyperson classification"},{"t":215.2,"txt":"would be your CWB ticket,"},{"t":217.4,"txt":"which allows you to weld structural steel,"},{"t":219.5,"txt":"or your B pressure,"},{"t":220.5,"txt":"which allows you to weld pipe."},{"t":223.7,"txt":"I would tell anyone interested in a welding career"},{"t":226.1,"txt":"to pursue it."},{"t":226.9,"txt":"You have the opportunities to develop lifelong friends,"},{"t":229.7,"txt":"have a high standard of living,"},{"t":231.5,"txt":"and be very involved in your community."},{"t":236.1,"txt":"One of the major things"},{"t":236.9,"txt":"that I enjoy about my job is"},{"t":239.1,"txt":"being able to start something from nothing"},{"t":241.5,"txt":"and standing back"},{"t":242.5,"txt":"and being like,"},{"t":243.3,"txt":"\"wow, I built that\"."},{"t":246.1,"txt":"If you like making things out of metal"},{"t":248,"txt":"using precise techniques"},{"t":249.3,"txt":"and you have the patience"},{"t":250.6,"txt":"to focus on detailed work"},{"t":252.1,"txt":"you could definitely build yourself a career"},{"t":254.6,"txt":"in welding."},{"t":255.8,"txt":"Learn more about this occupation"},{"t":257.5,"txt":"including training requirements"},{"t":258.9,"txt":"and salary ranges"},{"t":260,"txt":"in the occupational profile"},{"t":261.6,"txt":"on the alis website."},{"t":264,"txt":"Explore the possibilities."},{"t":265.9,"txt":"Go to alis.alberta.ca."}],"words":[{"t":10.1,"w":"Does"},{"t":10.1,"w":"the"},{"t":10.1,"w":"thought"},{"t":10.1,"w":"of"},{"t":10.1,"w":"building"},{"t":10.1,"w":"things"},{"t":11.48,"w":"spark"},{"t":11.48,"w":"your"},{"t":11.48,"w":"interest?"},{"t":12.84,"w":"Can"},{"t":12.84,"w":"you"},{"t":12.84,"w":"focus"},{"t":12.84,"w":"on"},{"t":12.84,"w":"details"},{"t":12.84,"w":"and"},{"t":14.34,"w":"work"},{"t":14.34,"w":"with"},{"t":14.34,"w":"little"},{"t":14.34,"w":"supervision?"},{"t":16.48,"w":"Are"},{"t":16.48,"w":"you"},{"t":16.48,"w":"good"},{"t":16.48,"w":"at"},{"t":16.48,"w":"working"},{"t":16.48,"w":"with"},{"t":16.48,"w":"your"},{"t":16.48,"w":"hands?"},{"t":18.5,"w":"If"},{"t":18.5,"w":"so,"},{"t":18.5,"w":"maybe"},{"t":18.5,"w":"you"},{"t":18.5,"w":"should"},{"t":18.5,"w":"fabricate"},{"t":18.5,"w":"yourself"},{"t":20.96,"w":"a"},{"t":20.96,"w":"career"},{"t":20.96,"w":"as"},{"t":20.96,"w":"a"},{"t":20.96,"w":"Welder."},{"t":23.32,"w":"In"},{"t":23.32,"w":"Alberta"},{"t":24.2,"w":"there"},{"t":24.2,"w":"are"},{"t":24.2,"w":"two"},{"t":24.2,"w":"branches"},{"t":24.2,"w":"in"},{"t":24.2,"w":"the"},{"t":24.2,"w":"welding"},{"t":24.2,"w":"trade."},{"t":26.38,"w":"Welders"},{"t":26.38,"w":"use"},{"t":26.38,"w":"heat"},{"t":26.38,"w":"to"},{"t":26.38,"w":"fuse"},{"t":26.38,"w":"metals"},{"t":26.38,"w":"together"},{"t":29.04,"w":"such"},{"t":29.04,"w":"as"},{"t":29.04,"w":"beams,"},{"t":29.04,"w":"girders,"},{"t":29.04,"w":"pipes,"},{"t":31.16,"w":"and"},{"t":31.16,"w":"other"},{"t":31.16,"w":"components."},{"t":32.84,"w":"Wire"},{"t":32.84,"w":"Process"},{"t":32.84,"w":"Operators"},{"t":34.38,"w":"work"},{"t":34.38,"w":"mostly"},{"t":34.38,"w":"in"},{"t":34.38,"w":"manufacturing"},{"t":36.12,"w":"and"},{"t":36.12,"w":"production"},{"t":36.12,"w":"plants"},{"t":37.12,"w":"where"},{"t":37.12,"w":"the